@step Preview the census facts AEAT holds for you.
@static aeat config profile censo pull
@blocked live-aeat The pull reads the AEAT sede consulta over an authenticated session; the sandbox refuses live frames.
@step Apply the facts returned by a new authenticated read; this does not resume the earlier preview.
@static aeat config profile censo pull --apply
@blocked live-aeat The current CLI apply performs another authenticated AEAT read, so the sandbox cannot execute it or treat the earlier preview as its reviewed operand.
